          text: '{"query":"# Use this example as a template for modifying the other
            examples. You will need to have the appropriate permissions for the
            requested information. \n# At this moment mutations must be done as
            the owner of the organization unless specified here or in the schema
            documentation.\n\nquery {\n\tlogin {\n\t\t#account ID is the
            organization id. \n\t\taccount(id: \"xx:xx\") {\n\t\t\t#rest of the
            query for example...\n\t\t\tdevices (size:1000, from:0)
            {\n\t\t\t\thasMore\n\t\t\t\titems
            {\n\t\t\t\t\tid\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#end of nested part of
            the query.\n\t\t}\n\t}\n}\n"}'
