            1000)\n      {\n\t\t\t\thasMore\n\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\tlast\n\t\t\t\titems
            {\n\t\t\t\t\tid\n        \towner
            {\n          \temail\n        \t}\n\t\t\t\t\tuser
            {\n\t   \t\t\t\temail\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tcreated\n\t\t\t\t\tupdated\n\t\t\t\t\t#
            One of the following
            FAILED,WAITING,RUNNING,SUCCESS,CANCELLED\n\t\t\t\t\tstatus\n\t\t\t\t\t#tags
            associated with job\n\t\t\t\t\ttags
            {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tname\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t#ANY/ALL (i.e.
            or/and)\n\t\t\t\t\ttagOperator,\n\t\t\t\t\tfileVersion
            {\n\t   \t\t\t\tid\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfile {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tname\n\t\t\t\t
