            tags at time of execution)\n\t\t#ANY/ALL (i.e. or/and), when tags
            are used, operator should accompany\n    tagFilter: {operator: ANY,
            values:[\"reboot\"]},\n    arguments: [\n      {\n        name:
            \"url\"\n        value:
            \"https://remote.it\"\n      },\n      {\n        name:
            \"imageFile\"\n        value:
            \"3f5f04d4-23f4-4cd8-a9ba-70814952dff7\"\n      },\n      {\n        name:
            \"bookmarkName\"\n        value:
            \"RemoteIt\"\n      },\n      {\n        name:
